	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Cogor, clarissime <persName ref="p495">Bulinger</persName>e, accelerare discessum meum cum propter sumptus, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>qui iam superare videntur vires meas, tum etiam propter res domesticas, quę me <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>absente tam diu penitus peribunt.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Decrevi itaque <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName> proficisci, ut <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illinc me expediam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si interim redibit D. <persName ref="p8049">Vadianus</persName>, vel sistam me huc, si <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>potero, vel literis agam, si quid fieri poterit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tu interim, amabo, cura, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut, quamprimum licuerit, causas illas, quas abs te efflagitavi, <placeName ref="l93">Clavennam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ad doctorem <persName>Augustinum</persName> transmittas eo ordine, ut mihi reddantur, et si quid <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pręterea habueris dignum necessitudine nostra.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Accessit pręterea, quod ii mihi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>affirmarunt <persName ref="p8049">Vadianum</persName> non posse reverti ante quindecim dies.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hanc moram <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sustinere neutiquam possum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quare si isthuc venerit, ut spero, posses, si ita <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tibi videbitur, hac de re secum transigere et adhibere consulem vestrum, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>qui fidem sibi faciat de literis iam mihi concessis ac simul hortetur, ut mihi ab hoc <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>senatu procuratorię impetrentur etiam me absente, ne huc mihi sit redeundum, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>saltem commendatitię ne desint.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nunc cognoscam, quantum efficere possint <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tuus erga me amor et pietas erga hanc causam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fac, oro, me certiorem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>de his omnibus dominumque rogato, ut succurrat rebus meis sic afflictis et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ecclesię suę tam graviter laboranti.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tu fęlicem vitam in ipso semper agas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Dominum <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Waltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p1283">Gisnerum</persName> et reliquos salutabis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>meo nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Dominum <persName ref="p8049">Vadianum</persName> erudire poteris de tota hac causa; nam mihi prę nimia <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>temporis angustia non licuit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ego relinquam hic in scriptis, quę huic <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>negocio necessaria fore videntur, ut sibi reddantur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>meque diligas.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Si iterum venero ad vos, ut spero, oportebit me <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>munitum esse validiori stomacho et locupletiore crumena.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Datum <placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> ad 28. Junii 1549.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Cras <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName> proficiscar, deinde in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p152">Balth[asar] Alt[eriu<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>s</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">[...] ate et eruditione ornatissimo [dom<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ino] <persName ref="p495">Henryco Bulingero</persName>, ministro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tygurinę</placeName> dignissimo, domino observando<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tygurum</placeName><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
